          "ruleId": "tests-staticmethod-decorator-order",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "Decorator order of a static test method: fixture registration outermost, then @staticmethod, then pytest marks. Swap `@c.Tests.MARK.parametrize(\n        \"consumer\",\n        [\n            \"ESCAPE = RedundantRelay\\n\",\n            \"class Derived(RedundantRelay):\\n    pass\\n\",\n            'def value(arg: \"RedundantRelay\") -> None:\\n    pass\\n',\n            \"VALUE = RedundantRelay.Unknown\\n\",\n            \"RedundantRelay.First = str\\n\",\n        ],\n    )` and `@staticmethod`."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "tests/unit/codemod/test_model_alias_retirement.py",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
