          "ruleId": "ban-test-doubles",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "Test doubles are forbidden: mock libraries, the mocker fixture, Mock/patch constructors, monkeypatch attribute/item replacement, HTTP recording/replay libraries (responses, requests_mock, vcr, aioresponses, pytest_httpx, httpx.MockTransport) and time doubles (freezegun, time_machine) hide the real owner. Delete the test and re-cover the behaviour through the public facade with real typed fixtures."
