                "src/flext_infra/_pytest_entry.py:18:1 [ban-loose-module-object] Loose object at module level: nest `_STARTED_AT_MONOTONIC` inside the module's single facade class. Only that class, its canonical published bindings, __all__ and imports live at module level in every Python file of the repository; the sole exceptions are a guarded executable `main()`, generator-emitted dunders and, in conftest.py and tests/fixtures/** only, pytest fixtures and hooks.",
                "src/flext_infra/_settings.py:16:6 [ban-flext-core-library-import] `pydantic_settings` is owned by flext-core: route through its c/t/p/m/u facades (settings through the settings facade; only layer-zero settings modules declare `class X(FlextSettings, BaseSettings)`) and close a missing member at flext-core.",
