                "src/flext_infra/_settings.py:18:6 [ban-reverse-runtime-import--flext_infra--settings] Reverse runtime import: lazy exports and compose modules do not change layer ownership. Move runtime behavior to its owning layer; TYPE_CHECKING is only valid when the dependency is exclusively an annotation.",
                "src/flext_infra/_settings.py:18:1 [ban-own-family-internal-import--flext_infra--flext_infra._models] Own-package import of a private family's internal module from outside that family. Internal modules are imported only by their family and its facade; bind the facade (its letter, under TYPE_CHECKING when it is a later layer).",
                "src/flext_infra/_settings.py:15:39 [import-header--foreign-origin--flext_infra--last] Outside the families, `flext_infra` binds every letter from its own root, never from another package.",
