                "src/flext_infra/_utilities/gate_admission.py:728:13 [ban-octal-mode-literal] Mode literal duplicates the config SSOT: read config.Infra.codegen.modes (file_default / file_private / directory_private / directory_generated) instead of hardcoding an octal mode at the call site.",
                "src/flext_infra/_utilities/gate_admission.py:159:13 [ban-ambient-environ-read--flext_infra] Ambient os.environ/os.getenv read outside the typed settings boundary: read the value through config.<Ns>.* or settings.<Ns>.* (owned by settings.py / _settings/) instead of the raw process environment.",
                "src/flext_infra/_utilities/gate_admission.py:713:13 [ban-silent-failure-sentinel] A failure path collapses into a sentinel: unwrap_or(<sentinel>), a broad except that neither re-raises nor returns a failure, or an except / result guard branch that returns None, a boolean or an empty collection. Return the typed failure or let the exception escape.",
                "src/flext_infra/_utilities/gate_admission.py:359:30 [ban-facade-letter-local-binding] [ban-facade-letter-local-binding] A local variable named like a facade letter shadows the facade binding — fix: rename the variable after the value it holds (for example `entry`, `subject`, `probe`) · ref: ENFORCE-051",
