                "src/flext_infra/_utilities/generation_inventory.py:38:1 [ban-loose-module-object] Loose object at module level: nest `FlextInfraGenerationInventory` inside the module's single facade class. Only that class, its canonical published bindings, __all__ and imports live at module level in every Python file of the repository; the sole exceptions are a guarded executable `main()`, generator-emitted dunders and, in conftest.py and tests/fixtures/** only, pytest fixtures and hooks.",
                "src/flext_infra/_utilities/generation_inventory.py:46:1 [ban-loose-module-object] Loose object at module level: nest `FlextInfraUtilitiesGenerationInventory` inside the module's single facade class. Only that class, its canonical published bindings, __all__ and imports live at module level in every Python file of the repository; the sole exceptions are a guarded executable `main()`, generator-emitted dunders and, in conftest.py and tests/fixtures/** only, pytest fixtures and hooks.",
