                "tests/unit/refactor/test_infra_refactor_import_normalization.py:737:1 [ban-loose-module-object] Loose object at module level: nest `TestsFlextInfraNamespaceImportNormalization` inside the module's single facade class. Only that class, its canonical published bindings, __all__ and imports live at module level in every Python file of the repository; the sole exceptions are a guarded executable `main()`, generator-emitted dunders and, in conftest.py and tests/fixtures/** only, pytest fixtures and hooks.",
                "tests/unit/refactor/test_infra_refactor_import_normalization.py:14:1 [ban-test-direct-tests-submodule] Test code imports a `tests` submodule directly. Import the public name from the generated `tests` namespace root; wire fixture modules through `pytest_plugins` strings.",
